<div class="wrapper privacy-page">
  <h1>Privacy Notice</h1>
  <p class="privacy-page__updated">This is a plain-language summary, not a legal document. Questions? <a href="/contact/">Contact Julia</a>.</p>

  <h2>What this site stores in your browser</h2>
  <p>Saved listings and your recently-viewed listings are stored using your browser's local storage. That data stays on your device — it's never sent to Julia, to us, or to anyone else. Clearing your browser's site data removes it.</p>

  <h2>Forms on this site</h2>
  <p>The newsletter signup, the contact form, and the "What's My Home Worth?" form are built and validated, but as of this writing they are <strong>not yet connected to an email or lead-management service</strong> — submitting one shows an on-page message saying so rather than sending your information anywhere. This notice will be updated once a real service is connected, and that section will describe what's collected and how it's used.</p>

  <h2>Embedded maps</h2>
  <p>Listing pages and the Contact page embed a Google Map. Loading that embed connects to Google, which may set its own cookies or collect usage data under <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google's own privacy policy</a> — this site doesn't control that.</p>

  <h2>Analytics</h2>
  <p>This site does not currently use any analytics or tracking service. If that changes, this page will be updated to say what's in use.</p>

  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>This site does not set its own cookies. The embedded map above may set cookies belonging to Google.</p>
</div>
